    <MetaInfo>
      <NameIsFileName value="True" />
      <Name>05_transform_load</Name>
      <Description>Transform and load the warehouse. Reads the stg.*Valid queue from 04, derives every dimension and fact in Alteryx (Dim_Team Type-2 SCD, batting / bowling, partnerships and fall of wicket via Multi-Row Formula, over summary), stages them in stg.LoadReady_* by natural code, then publishes with dw.usp_PublishWarehouse: surrogate keys resolved and everything applied in one transaction. Idempotent: a re-run with nothing new changes nothing.</Description>
